# Domain-level redirect for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Why this file exists: www.ljx520.me is registered as a custom domain on the
# Pages project, and traffic for that hostname does not pass through the zone's
# dynamic-redirect ruleset (verified: the same path rule fires on ljx520.me but
# is never evaluated on www.ljx520.me). Pages evaluates _redirects itself, so
# the hop is made here instead of in Cloudflare Rules.
#
# Rules are evaluated top-down; the first match wins.

# www -> apex, keeping path and query string
https://www.ljx520.me/*  https://ljx520.me/:splat  301
